  DisplayName: The Nuremberg Toy Fair
  EventType: 1
  Description: The toymakers of Nuremberg {have laid out|will lay out} their wares
    for the buyers from abroad. Alongside the new stock, old tin and wooden pieces
    {are turning|will turn} up from the workshops' back rooms, and collectors of
    childhood things {follow|will follow} close behind.
